WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.800
[Electronic music] A textured scan of ROB turns as the cyan Optical Head title appears beside it.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:09.300
The view moves down the chassis. A new label identifies the twin chest speakers.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:15.000
The framing shifts to the tracked base, then eases back to show the robot.
